          steps: [r`I=\frac{\pi\cdot30^4}{64}=39{,}761\ \text{mm}^4`, r`P_{cr}=\frac{\pi^2\cdot200000\cdot39761}{2000^2}=19.6\ \text{kN}`, r`\lambda_c=\pi\sqrt{2E/S_y}\approx126\quad(S_y=250\ \text{MPa})`, r`\lambda=\frac{2000}{7.5}=267>\lambda_c\ \Rightarrow\ \text{Euler valid}`],
